---
title: "beacon_block_kzg_validation (Fulu -- Networking (P2P Interface))"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_get_epoch: epoch = get_current_epoch(state)
    q_get_epoch --> q_get_max: max_blobs = get_blob_parameters(epoch).max_blobs_per_block
    q_get_max --> q_check_len: len(signed_beacon_block.message.body.blob_kzg_commitments) <= max_blobs
    q_check_len --> q_accept: len(blob_kzg_commitments) <= max_blobs
    q_check_len --> q_reject: len(blob_kzg_commitments) > max_blobs [REJECT]
    q_reject --> [*]: reject
    q_accept --> [*]: accept
    note right of q_accept
        INV-001: max_blobs_per_block is epoch-dependent via get_blob_parameters
        INV-002: Blocks with zero commitments are valid (no lower bound check)
    end note
